<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines C.Bank to hold press conference.</title>
<headline>Philippines C.Bank to hold press conference.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Central Bank Governor Gabriel Singson will hold a press conference on Friday at 10 am (0200 GMT).</p>
<p>A Bank statement gave no other details.  </p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
